          </div>
          <div>
            <p><seg source="#source-277346-277349">『</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-277349-277418"><seg source="#source-277364-277394">ヴァイオリン・ソナタ</seg></hi><seg source="#source-277418-277421">＝</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-277421-277469"><seg source="#source-277436-277445">イ長調</seg></hi>』</p>
