            <p><seg source="#source-552457-552460">『</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-552460-552517"><seg source="#source-552475-552493">チェロ奏鳴曲</seg></hi><seg source="#source-552517-552520">＝</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-552520-552568"><seg source="#source-552535-552544">ホ短調</seg></hi>』（ブラームス・作品三八）</p>
