          </div>
          <div type="layout" source="#source-552739-552942" style="padding-inline-start: 12em">
            <p><seg source="#source-552763-552766">（</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-552766-552832"><seg source="#source-552781-552808">ビクターＪＤ九九三</seg></hi><seg source="#source-552832-552835">―</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-552835-552877"><seg source="#source-552850-552853">五</seg></hi><seg source="#source-552877-552880">、</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-552880-552937"><seg source="#source-552895-552913">名曲集六五〇</seg></hi><seg source="#source-552937-552942">）</seg></p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p><seg source="#source-552942-552945">『</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-552945-553002"><seg source="#source-552960-552978">チェロ奏鳴曲</seg></hi><seg source="#source-553002-553005">＝</seg><hi rend="bold" source="#source-553005-553053"><seg source="#source-553020-553029">ト短調</seg></hi>』（ベートーヴェン・作品五ノ二）</p>
